<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed sharply lower on Monday in heavy trading.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average fell 192.25 to 7604.26.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite fell 9.35 to 458.49.</p>
<p>The average price per share fell $0.90.</p>
<p>Decliners beat advancers 1,771 to 816.</p>
<p>Volume was 492,692,680 compared with 652,725,670 on Friday.</p>
